null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_01_f","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_5","text":"Good morning.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_6","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_6","text":"Makoto places a plastic bag on the table.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_7","text":"What's that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_01_f","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_8","text":"I saw something interesting on my way here, so I bought some.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_01_f","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_9","text":"I think they're called candy-flavored shish kebabs?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02_f","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_10","text":"Aren't they called kebab-flavored candy?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_11","text":"They both sound kind of weird, though...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_04","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_12","text":"They're beary good!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_13","text":"Affirmative! I've never tasted anything like it in my life!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_14","text":"Meh, it's not really my thing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_15","text":"You're the only one who hasn't tried it yet, Monsieur, so do give it a taste.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_16","text":"Commander, consider this another challenge. Let us begin the candy-flavored kebab challenge!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_17","text":"I don't know about that...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_18","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_18","text":"We chat for a while about nothing in particular.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_19","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_19","text":"... The candy-flavored kebabs really do taste bizarre.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_20","text":"So what brings you all to my room?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_01_f","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_21","text":"We think it's almost time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_22","text":"Time for...? Oh.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_c","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_23","text":"The D-Wave scent is almost gone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_24","text":"When will it disappear completely?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_c","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_25","text":"Tomorrow.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_26","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_27","text":"Are you sure?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_c","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_28","text":"Teddie said the same thing, so it's probably right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_29","text":"I see...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_04","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_30","text":"So we came to bid you bearwell!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_31","text":"Hmm... Something feels kinda strange.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_32","text":"Don't you think so, Teddie?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_04","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_33","text":"To be honest, I don't want to say good-bear to you, Mira-chan, Leo-chan, or anyone else...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_04","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_34","text":"But I've had a beary great time! So I'll treasure these feelings and brace myself for what's ahead!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02_f","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_35","text":"Yeah, I was a little sad too when Teddie and Mona-chan told me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02_f","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_36","text":"But we all shared so many wonderful memories together.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02_f","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_37","text":"So I wanted us to part with smiles...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_38","text":"Yeah...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_39","text":"What did you think of your time in the Ark?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_40","text":"Aigis, you visited the M.M.R. Vocational School, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_03","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_41","text":"Yes, my time there as Naru 4 was very rewarding.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02_f","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_42","text":"I had fun too. I got to visit a beautiful hot spring where I could see the snow, and I even got to join an overnight get-together.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_01_f","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_43","text":"I stopped by the library, where Phantom recommended a few books to me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_01_f","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_44","text":"There were so many worthwhile books that I came away with a much broader perspective. Honestly, I already want to read more.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_c","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_45","text":"I had a blast exploring all over the Ark too. I'd hate to lose all these memories.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_46","text":"Huh? Why would you lose them?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_47","text":"Do you have a bad memory?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_c","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_48","text":"No, that's not it... Everyone who was knocked unconscious by the D-Waves lost all their memories of the time they were out, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_c","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_49","text":"We were summoned by the D-Waves too, so once we go back... there's a good chance we'll lose all our memories of what happened while we were under their influence.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_50","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_51","text":"Are you going to forget about us?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_c","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_52","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_05_c","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_53","text":"Yeah... I think so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_54","text":"Come on, enough with the depressing talk.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_55","text":"I heard they're officially calling this a \"mass loss of consciousness and memory\" incident.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_2_epilogue_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_2_epilogue_56","text":"Since it was caused by the D-Waves, the higher-ups probably just wanted to sweep it under the rug. Luckily, it didn't turn into anything bigger.","